# The section that was /games/ is /apps/. Most of what lives there is not a game — the typing
# trainer, the guitar flashcards, the tuner, the sleep log — and the ones that are lose nothing by
# sitting under a heading that no longer claims to describe them.
#
# 301 rather than 302 because the old routes are not coming back. Note what this does to an
# already-installed home-screen app: its start_url redirects out of its own scope, so iOS opens
# the target in Safari instead of the app. That is what renaming a PWA's routes means, and the
# fix is deleting the old icon and installing the new one once.
#
# The old fretboard/transpose routes are listed before the catch-all, because first match wins
# and /games/fretboard must reach the flashcards rather than a /apps/fretboard that does not
# exist. The stats tabs land on their own halves rather than on the practice screen: someone
# with /games/fretboard/stats bookmarked wants a progress page, and the neck heatmap is still
# one. See the "Flashcards" section of CLAUDE.md.

/games/fretboard              /apps/flashcards           301
/games/fretboard/stats        /apps/flashcards/neck      301
/games/transpose              /apps/flashcards           301
/games/transpose/stats        /apps/flashcards/chords    301

/pl/games/fretboard           /pl/apps/flashcards        301
/pl/games/fretboard/stats     /pl/apps/flashcards/neck   301
/pl/games/transpose           /pl/apps/flashcards        301
/pl/games/transpose/stats     /pl/apps/flashcards/chords 301

/apps/fretboard               /apps/flashcards           301
/apps/fretboard/stats         /apps/flashcards/neck      301
/apps/transpose               /apps/flashcards           301
/apps/transpose/stats         /apps/flashcards/chords    301

/pl/apps/fretboard            /pl/apps/flashcards        301
/pl/apps/fretboard/stats      /pl/apps/flashcards/neck   301
/pl/apps/transpose            /pl/apps/flashcards        301
/pl/apps/transpose/stats      /pl/apps/flashcards/chords 301

/games/*                      /apps/:splat               301
/pl/games/*                   /pl/apps/:splat            301
